Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.36,0:00:07.13,Opening,,0,0,0,,{\fad(800,0)}The radiance of the night shines through my window
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.13,0:00:11.08,Opening,,0,0,0,,but the path to immortality is long.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.56,0:00:15.81,Opening,,0,0,0,,The Eight Views and Nine-Bend Streams are desolate.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.81,0:00:20.97,Opening,,0,0,0,,Living beings question the miseries of the world over a jar of wine.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.24,0:00:24.96,Opening,,0,0,0,,Forget about Nirvana and rebirth,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.36,0:00:28.21,Opening,,0,0,0,,I will break through the waves with my own flesh and blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.21,0:00:33.48,Opening,,0,0,0,,The heavens are vast, so what if I was born mediocre ?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.68,0:00:37.44,Opening,,0,0,0,,I stare at the Dao in my moments of madness
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.80,0:00:40.44,Opening,,0,0,0,,as the storm rages just below.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.84,0:00:44.81,Opening,,0,0,0,,I've been thinking about life and death in my dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.81,0:00:47.80,Opening,,0,0,0,,I've unsheathed my sword to ask the immortals
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.96,0:00:50.65,Opening,,0,0,0,,why the world is a-changing.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.67,0:00:54.00,Opening,,0,0,0,,Heaven and earth reveals its poignant truths.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.24,0:00:57.17,Opening,,0,0,0,,Swallow the Four Seas and the Eight Wastelands,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.17,0:01:00.25,Opening,,0,0,0,,experience all the vicissitudes of life in an instant.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.41,0:01:03.13,Opening,,0,0,0,,I will defy the light in the sky
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.13,0:01:06.57,Opening,,0,0,0,,to continue to write a new chapter for all things in the three realms of existence.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.65,0:01:19.01,Opening,,0,0,0,,Just a thought separates mortal from immortal.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.17,0:01:22.09,Opening,,0,0,0,,Transform your insignificant body into light.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.25,0:01:25.21,Opening,,0,0,0,,The hardships of the journey
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.33,0:01:28.17,Opening,,0,0,0,,will temper this young man's heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.17,0:01:32.81,Opening,,0,0,0,,If I become a Renegade Immortal, will I hesitate to fight the heavens ?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.56,0:01:43.44,Opening,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,690)\fad(1000,1000)}Renegade Immortal\NSubtitles by Bonobosubs\Nhttps://discord.gg/Ceckd4pdVA
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.11,0:01:53.38,Sub,,0,0,0,,Little fellow...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.23,0:01:54.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,What the...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.83,0:01:57.70,Sub,,0,0,0,,Did you think resisting Heaven's Might was the end ?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.11,0:01:59.06,Sub,,0,0,0,,This
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.43,0:02:01.18,Sub,,0,0,0,,is just the beginning !
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.71,0:02:03.70,Sub,,0,0,0,,Soul Seizing !
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.39,0:02:05.38,Sub,,0,0,0,,You wish !
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.43,0:02:21.78,Sub,,0,0,0,,Your Origin Soul
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.23,0:02:23.82,Sub,,0,0,0,,is mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.23,0:02:26.78,Sub,,0,0,0,,For countless years,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.39,0:02:29.58,Sub,,0,0,0,,I have been devouring every single cultivator
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.59,0:02:33.10,Sub,,0,0,0,,that reached Ascendant in the Demon Spirit Land.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.39,0:02:35.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,Scram !
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.79,0:02:41.10,Sub,,0,0,0,,This spell is really strange.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.23,0:02:44.02,Sub,,0,0,0,,If I hadn't used my killing intent to stay conscious,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.19,0:02:47.10,Sub,,0,0,0,,my Origin Soul would have been extracted by now.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.99,0:02:48.98,Sub,,0,0,0,,I must leave quickly.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.99,0:02:51.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,This arm
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.83,0:02:54.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,was able to breach the restrictions of the Celestial's cave.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.39,0:02:55.50,Sub,,0,0,0,,I can't underestimate it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.51,0:02:57.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,Since I just reached Ascendant,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.99,0:02:59.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,my cultivation is unstable.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.79,0:03:01.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,I should seek the Ancient Demon Spirit first
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.43,0:03:03.42,Sub,,0,0,0,,to have him help me find another spot to cultivate.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.75,0:03:09.98,Sub,,0,0,0,,He actually escaped...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.79,0:03:12.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,A Defiant Cultivator
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.19,0:03:13.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,really is troublesome...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.63,0:03:15.78,Sub,,0,0,0,,I was gravely wounded
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.43,0:03:18.02,Sub,,0,0,0,,by the battle back then.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.79,0:03:21.02,Sub,,0,0,0,,I need origin energy to recover my cultivation.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.91,0:03:23.10,Sub,,0,0,0,,But origin energy
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.51,0:03:26.62,Sub,,0,0,0,,only manifests when an outsider reaches Ascendant.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.15,0:03:30.98,Sub,,0,0,0,,Having a fresh Ascendant cultivator is really rare...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.71,0:03:34.90,Sub,,0,0,0,,How could I let you go !?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.99,0:03:45.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,He interfered with the teleportation formation...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.39,0:03:47.94,Sub,,0,0,0,,Who the hell is this person ?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.43,0:03:51.59,Card,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\pos(1625,517)}Celestial Ascension Fruits Field\NFire Demon Country
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.07,0:03:52.62,Sub,,0,0,0,,These are...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.35,0:03:54.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,Celestial Ascension Fruits ?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.35,0:03:57.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's said that consuming them can briefly increase cultivation
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.07,0:04:00.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,but they can also awaken killing intent or the true desires of the heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.59,0:04:02.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,They can cause a severe intoxicating feeling
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.63,0:04:04.41,Sub,,0,0,0,,that could lead to succumbing to inner demons.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.87,0:04:06.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,I've seen this fruit on planet Suzaku before
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.19,0:04:08.98,Sub,,0,0,0,,but I never thought it existed in the Demon Spirit Land.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.71,0:04:19.86,Sub,,0,0,0,,You just won't leave me alone !
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.91,0:04:22.78,Sub,,0,0,0,,The fiend has finally summoned me !
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.11,0:04:24.22,Sub,,0,0,0,,If I perform today,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.39,0:04:26.46,Sub,,0,0,0,,I'm sure he'll forgive me for my betrayal.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.39,0:04:29.34,Sub,,0,0,0,,Hey ! Hey ! Hey !
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.71,0:04:31.82,Sub,,0,0,0,,Who dares to harm my Master ?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.03,0:04:38.86,Sub,,0,0,0,,Master,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.87,0:04:40.06,Sub,,0,0,0,,save me !
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.31,0:04:41.02,Sub,,0,0,0,,Demonic Finger !
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.59,0:04:53.50,Sub,,0,0,0,,Is this thing
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.99,0:04:54.62,Sub,,0,0,0,,destroyed ?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.19,0:04:55.82,Sub,,0,0,0,,Something's wrong...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.39,0:04:58.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,The armor is the source of the demonic aura !
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.23,0:05:09.10,Sub,,0,0,0,,You...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.43,0:05:11.14,Sub,,0,0,0,,are mine !
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.31,0:05:13.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,Master, be careful !
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.03,0:05:19.66,Sub,,0,0,0,,Life and Death Reincarnation Cycle !
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.51,0:05:46.90,Sub,,0,0,0,,This sound disturbs my soul,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.35,0:05:48.38,Sub,,0,0,0,,it's nauseating.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.27,0:05:51.42,Sub,,0,0,0,,With my mind blurred,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.99,0:05:52.94,Sub,,0,0,0,,I'm just meat
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.55,0:05:54.74,Sub,,0,0,0,,on his plate.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.23,0:06:05.78,Sub,,0,0,0,,You are mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.43,0:06:11.30,Sub,,0,0,0,,I must...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.55,0:06:13.94,Sub,,0,0,0,,stay conscious...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.39,0:06:20.22,Sub,,0,0,0,,Since I can't fight fair...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.51,0:06:22.42,Sub,,0,0,0,,then...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.47,0:06:33.42,Sub,,0,0,0,,I'll use my killing intent !
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.07,0:06:58.02,Sub,,0,0,0,,Kill !
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.67,0:06:59.62,Sub,,0,0,0,,Kill !!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.19,0:07:01.02,Sub,,0,0,0,,Kill !!!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.07,0:07:10.86,Sub,,0,0,0,,You...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.71,0:07:35.02,Sub,,0,0,0,,Reincarnation cycle...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.95,0:07:37.34,Sub,,0,0,0,,Annihilation !
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.59,0:07:52.34,Sub,,0,0,0,,He dares to use killing intent against me !?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.71,0:07:53.42,Sub,,0,0,0,,Madman !
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.31,0:07:57.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,This one has succumbed to inner demons.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.51,0:07:58.82,Sub,,0,0,0,,Capturing him would cost more
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.15,0:08:01.58,Sub,,0,0,0,,than the origin energy I'll gain.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.23,0:08:03.78,Sub,,0,0,0,,It wouldn't benefit me
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.11,0:08:05.74,Sub,,0,0,0,,to capture him now.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.23,0:08:06.74,Sub,,0,0,0,,Enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.27,0:08:09.06,Sub,,0,0,0,,I accumulated energy for tens of thousands of years,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.43,0:08:10.42,Sub,,0,0,0,,I can't lose it all now.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.47,0:08:13.78,Sub,,0,0,0,,Are you fleeing now ?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.51,0:08:25.98,Sub,,0,0,0,,Found you...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.11,0:08:29.14,Sub,,0,0,0,,M...Master...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.23,0:08:31.38,Sub,,0,0,0,,shouldn't we heal our wounds first ?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.03,0:08:32.82,Sub,,0,0,0,,What ?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.47,0:08:36.10,Sub,,0,0,0,,N...N...Nothing !
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.51,0:08:37.62,Sub,,0,0,0,,What I meant was...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.83,0:08:40.78,Sub,,0,0,0,,we need to strike now while he's off-guard !
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.39,0:08:43.10,Sub,,0,0,0,,We're doomed...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.15,0:08:45.46,Sub,,0,0,0,,The fiend of the Sea of Devils is back.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.67,0:08:46.18,Sub,,0,0,0,,No, wait...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.15,0:08:48.78,Sub,,0,0,0,,he's even more terrifying than before.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.31,0:08:52.18,Sub,,0,0,0,,Those who disturb my Ascendant breakthrough
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.15,0:08:54.46,Sub,,0,0,0,,must die !
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.99,0:09:12.50,Sub,,0,0,0,,A mere Early stage Ascendant
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.87,0:09:14.58,Sub,,0,0,0,,dares to provoke me !?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.59,0:09:18.54,Sub,,0,0,0,,Ten Thousand Demons Heart Devouring !
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.75,0:09:20.91,Card,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1730,503)\fad(300,000)}Central Plains\NFire Demon Country
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.91,0:09:33.66,Sub,,0,0,0,,Is that all you've got ?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.43,0:09:51.54,Sub,,0,0,0,,A single drop of this wine knocked you out for a year
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.59,0:09:53.38,Sub,,0,0,0,,but you just swallowed 4 drops !
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.55,0:09:54.30,Sub,,0,0,0,,You're crazy !
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.67,0:09:59.78,Sub,,0,0,0,,Come at me !
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.19,0:10:16.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,Exhilarating !
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.79,0:10:18.26,Sub,,0,0,0,,Make it more exhilarating !
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.03,0:10:47.66,Sub,,0,0,0,,His body is dead,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.91,0:10:49.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,his Origin Soul is collapsing.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.43,0:10:52.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,Yet, fueled by the Celestial Ascension Fruits and celestial spiritual energy,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.11,0:10:53.10,Sub,,0,0,0,,he is growing even more insane.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.23,0:10:55.66,Sub,,0,0,0,,At this speed...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.23,0:10:56.82,Sub,,0,0,0,,Indeed,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.67,0:10:59.38,Sub,,0,0,0,,we're already in the Central Plains.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.23,0:11:02.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,But since you're acting so conspicuously,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.43,0:11:04.94,Sub,,0,0,0,,the Fire Demon Country is bound to notice.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.71,0:11:07.42,Sub,,0,0,0,,You're courting death.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.99,0:11:17.27,Card,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,000)\pos(1539,507)}Zi Shu\NDa Lou Sword Sect disciple\NPeak Late stage Soul Transformation
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.11,0:11:20.26,Sub,,0,0,0,,An Ascendant cultivator ?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.35,0:11:22.70,Sub,,0,0,0,,And a severely injured one at that...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.63,0:11:25.22,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is a heaven-sent opportunity !
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.91,0:11:27.66,Sub,,0,0,0,,If I devour his Ascendant Origin Soul,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.03,0:11:30.22,Sub,,0,0,0,,it will benefit my Sword Spirit !
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.71,0:11:31.82,Sub,,0,0,0,,All troops, stand by.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.99,0:11:33.14,Sub,,0,0,0,,Stay here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.43,0:11:36.82,Sub,,0,0,0,,Such a fresh
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.75,0:11:38.90,Sub,,0,0,0,,killing intent.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.07,0:11:41.18,Sub,,0,0,0,,You are gravely injured,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.43,0:11:42.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,stop clinging to life !
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.47,0:11:44.82,Sub,,0,0,0,,Thanks for the medicine.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.99,0:11:50.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,The Commander
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.79,0:11:51.30,Sub,,0,0,0,,is dead !
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.03,0:11:52.66,Sub,,0,0,0,,Kill him !
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.99,0:11:54.42,Sub,,0,0,0,,Avenge the Commander !
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.47,0:11:55.54,Sub,,0,0,0,,Kill !
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.03,0:11:57.34,Sub,,0,0,0,,Death Finger...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.71,0:12:30.83,Card,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1701,491)\fad(300,300)}Imperial Palace\NFire Demon Country
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.35,0:12:29.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,Reporting to His Majesty,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.43,0:12:30.22,Sub,,0,0,0,,Zi Shu's army
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.91,0:12:31.94,Sub,,0,0,0,,has been annihilated.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.63,0:12:37.47,Card,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\pos(1684,482)}Demon Emperor\NFire Demon Country
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.83,0:12:37.46,Sub,,0,0,0,,He slaughtered 30 000 of my soldiers ?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.03,0:12:38.74,Sub,,0,0,0,,I will
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.95,0:12:40.22,Sub,,0,0,0,,carve out his heart and bones !
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.47,0:12:43.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,Issue the order,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.55,0:12:44.70,Sub,,0,0,0,,summon 100 000 troops.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.23,0:12:47.06,Sub,,0,0,0,,I'll use this madman's blood
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.79,0:12:49.30,Sub,,0,0,0,,to color my land !
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.35,0:12:49.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,Understood !
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.99,0:12:54.90,Sub,,0,0,0,,What an intense killing intent...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.51,0:12:59.55,Card,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,000)\pos(1641,488)}Tianyi City\NFire Demon Country
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.11,0:13:00.46,Sub,,0,0,0,,You killed my Commander
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.87,0:13:01.95,Card,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,000)\pos(1531,566)}Xuan Qi\NFire Demon Country Commander-in-chief\NRank 300 000 Demonic Energy\N(Early stage Ascendant)
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.47,0:13:01.82,Sub,,0,0,0,,and slaughtered my soldiers.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.07,0:13:03.06,Sub,,0,0,0,,But now I will
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.07,0:13:04.82,Sub,,0,0,0,,execute you right away
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.83,0:13:06.10,Sub,,0,0,0,,by imperial decree !
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.43,0:13:09.86,Sub,,0,0,0,,Activate...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.35,0:13:11.62,Sub,,0,0,0,,the Abyssal Demon Inferno Formation !
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.19,0:13:14.02,Sub,,0,0,0,,Kill !
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.23,0:13:20.86,Sub,,0,0,0,,Death...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.03,0:13:22.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,Finger !
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.07,0:13:35.70,Sub,,0,0,0,,A mere Early stage Ascendant
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.31,0:13:38.70,Sub,,0,0,0,,dares to run rampant in my Fire Demon Country !?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.43,0:13:52.42,Sub,,0,0,0,,The Abyssal Demon Inferno Formation
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.83,0:13:54.58,Sub,,0,0,0,,combines the strength of 100 000 soldiers
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.07,0:13:57.62,Sub,,0,0,0,,by using an Ascendant as the formation core.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.23,0:13:59.62,Sub,,0,0,0,,Let alone you,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.03,0:14:01.74,Sub,,0,0,0,,even a Late stage Ascendant
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.11,0:14:03.90,Sub,,0,0,0,,wouldn't escape it alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.19,0:14:11.67,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)}In a desperate situation
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.23,0:14:11.67,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)}I swallowed these blood-red fruits.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.83,0:14:14.23,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)}The Celestial Wine scorches
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.87,0:14:14.23,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)}my throat and soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.91,0:14:12.82,Sub,,0,0,0,,All troops, hear my order !
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.19,0:14:14.18,Sub,,0,0,0,,By the Emperor's decree,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.35,0:14:15.82,Sub,,0,0,0,,we will kill this man !
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.47,0:14:16.87,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)}Pain severed
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.51,0:14:16.87,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)}the locks on my nerves.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.39,0:14:17.82,Sub,,0,0,0,,Don't let him escape !
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.07,0:14:19.47,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)}A madman's smile
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.79,0:14:19.47,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)}appears in the corner of my mouth.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.03,0:14:20.30,Sub,,0,0,0,,Kill ! Kill ! Kill !
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.75,0:14:22.19,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)}My killing move falls like the rain. Pun intented
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.43,0:14:24.83,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)}as I laugh maniacally.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.95,0:14:27.39,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)}Let my sword slice through bones and flesh.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.67,0:14:31.35,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)}Savoring this
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.39,0:14:31.35,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)}near-death epiphany.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.71,0:14:35.87,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)}Adrenaline
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.71,0:14:35.87,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)}rushes through my veins.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.71,0:14:40.87,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)}As far as I can see,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.11,0:14:40.87,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)}everybody is my prey.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.45,0:14:45.51,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)}The lucidity of being possessed
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.95,0:14:45.51,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)}is the deepest curse.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.15,0:14:50.31,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)}Killing intent
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.87,0:14:50.31,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)}overflows and cannot be contained.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.15,0:14:57.62,Sub,,0,0,0,,This killing intent...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.63,0:15:00.62,Sub,,0,0,0,,is truly intoxicating.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.59,0:15:05.99,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)}Break through this path to the underworld.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.35,0:15:08.83,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,100)}With the reincarnation cycle as your prison,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.35,0:15:08.83,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,100)}you are condemned to eternal damnation.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.91,0:15:08.98,Sub,,0,0,0,,Impossible...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.99,0:15:12.75,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)}This city will serve as your tomb.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.27,0:15:16.63,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)}Break through this path to the underworld.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.95,0:15:19.51,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,100)}With the reincarnation cycle as your prison,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.95,0:15:19.51,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,100)}you are condemned to eternal damnation.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.71,0:15:23.47,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)}This city will serve as your tomb.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.47,0:15:31.78,Sub,,0,0,0,,He intends to break the formation !
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.23,0:15:39.30,Sub,,0,0,0,,Underworld Finger...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.27,0:15:41.82,Sub,,0,0,0,,Fall !
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.27,0:15:56.66,Sub,,0,0,0,,This...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.15,0:15:57.90,Sub,,0,0,0,,this isn't possible !
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.43,0:15:59.66,Sub,,0,0,0,,He just reached Ascendant,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.43,0:16:01.15,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)}Kill through your path of destiny
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.03,0:16:01.62,Sub,,0,0,0,,how could he have his own Dao ?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.07,0:16:04.59,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)}Through slaughter I shall prove my Dao,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.03,0:16:03.66,Sub,,0,0,0,,The Dao of the Underworld...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.07,0:16:04.59,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)}let the heavens and the earth bow down to me,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.83,0:16:08.75,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)}a king crowned in madness.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.43,0:16:06.86,Sub,,0,0,0,,By using the Celestial Ascension Fruits, the Celestial Wine,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.43,0:16:09.66,Sub,,0,0,0,,and the killing intent of this huge army to temper me,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.15,0:16:12.55,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)}Break through this path to the underworld.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.55,0:16:13.22,Sub,,0,0,0,,I've actually begun to grasp what the second step is:
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.91,0:16:15.39,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,100)}With the reincarnation cycle as your prison,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.91,0:16:15.39,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,100)}you are condemned to eternal damnation.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.55,0:16:17.26,Sub,,0,0,0,,materializing the heart's desires into reality.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.55,0:16:19.31,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)}This city will serve as your tomb.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.23,0:16:19.18,Sub,,0,0,0,,Interesting...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.07,0:16:21.22,Sub,,0,0,0,,From now on,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.83,0:16:24.22,Sub,,0,0,0,,I, Wang Lin, will cultivate neither the heavens nor the earth,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.83,0:16:27.02,Sub,,0,0,0,,neither celestials nor gods,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.79,0:16:29.66,Sub,,0,0,0,,I cultivate only my own Dao.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.95,0:16:33.54,Sub,,0,0,0,,Whoever wishes to kill me
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.83,0:16:35.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,shall be trapped in my Underworld River,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.27,0:16:37.82,Sub,,0,0,0,,my own reincarnation cycle
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.91,0:16:40.66,Sub,,0,0,0,,free from the heavens and the earth !
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.59,0:17:08.31,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,100)}I am the underworld.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.59,0:17:11.31,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,100)}I am the reincarnation cycle.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.07,0:17:15.59,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)}I am the end.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.03,0:17:38.26,Sub,,0,0,0,,With only an Early stage Ascendant cultivation,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.63,0:17:41.78,Sub,,0,0,0,,he has opened up his own underworld river...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.71,0:17:43.70,Sub,,0,0,0,,Wang Lin...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.51,0:17:46.66,Sub,,0,0,0,,you truly amaze me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.35,0:17:49.18,Sub,,0,0,0,,Ming Yuan !
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.95,0:17:53.91,Card,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1635,521)\fad(300,000)}Ming Yuan\NRank 500 000 Demonic Energy\N(Late stage Ascendant)
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.43,0:17:53.90,Sub,,0,0,0,,Master, what's your order ?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.43,0:17:56.34,Sub,,0,0,0,,Get ready to welcome our guest.
Dialogue: 100,0:18:00.63,0:20:34.91,Note,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,1000)}In the donghua the Celestial Ascension Fruits were renamed to the Demonic Possession Fruits. I disagree with that terminology. The state Wang Lin ends up in after consuming the fruit is due to his inner killing intent plus the fact that he overused the Demonic Finger before Ascendant and also because he cultivated the Celestial Slaughter Art. For other people the fruits will have other effects and this has implications later in the story. We'll see how they adapt it now...\NAlso, it was shown but not explained, the Death Finger can absorb energy.\N\NThese fruits are only the size of a baby’s fist, and they are completely purple and give off a strange fragrance. If a person were to eat one, they would become excited and feel extreme pleasures. This is why this fruit is called Celestial Ascension Fruit.\N\NIf a mortal were to eat one, they would become addicted, but it wouldn’t affect a cultivator much. However, there are cultivators who enjoy eating the fruit and losing themselves in that intoxicating feeling.\N\NIn the mortal world, only the rich and powerful can get Celestial Ascension Fruits from cultivators after paying a heavy price. Then they can immerse themselves in the intoxicating feeling like they have become celestials themselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.75,0:18:27.23,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}Ask
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.27,0:18:25.07,Stamp,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1514,677)}Qi Condensation
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.19,0:18:27.23,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}the perilous path filled with countless blades.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.71,0:18:28.35,Stamp,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1299,685)}Foundation Establishment
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.87,0:18:34.03,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}Can the mundane world be shattered
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.23,0:18:31.67,Stamp,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1557,705)\fad(800,000)}Core Formation
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.43,0:18:35.11,Stamp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(800,000)\pos(1557,705)}Nascent Soul
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.67,0:18:34.03,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}by a child's steadfast heart ?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.15,0:18:40.27,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}If the laws of this world
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.99,0:18:38.55,Stamp,,0,0,0,,{\pos(368,638)\fad(800,300)}Soul Formation
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.87,0:18:41.75,Stamp,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1445,688)\fad(800,000)}Soul Transformation
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.95,0:18:40.27,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}stand in the way,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.23,0:18:47.07,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}I'll defy the universe to tread the heavens
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.07,0:18:48.03,Stamp,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1574,688)\fad(800,000)}Ascendant
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.43,0:18:47.07,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}and ask this question to the sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.51,0:18:52.95,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}My heart's deepest wish
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.89,0:18:52.95,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}is to not kneel before these mountains and rivers.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.11,0:19:00.03,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}Don't accept your doomed fate,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.67,0:19:00.03,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}karma can be changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.43,0:19:05.79,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}Unwilling to let go,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.95,0:19:05.79,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}my obsessions propel me forward.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.79,0:19:13.31,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}Don't be afraid.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.11,0:19:13.31,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}Thunder rumbles as I dare to tread through the reincarnation cycle.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.27,0:19:17.71,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,300)}Accept your fate and stay mortal or defy it to become immortal.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.71,0:19:17.71,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,300)}Hold fast to this resolve and break through the obstacles.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.83,0:19:21.55,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}I'll fight all those who dare to stand in my way.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.15,0:19:21.55,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}Let the winds of war heed my command.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.63,0:19:27.27,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}I sign this question with my heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.23,0:19:27.27,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}What is the Dao ?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.59,0:19:31.11,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}Defying the flow of heaven and earth,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.95,0:19:31.11,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}the heart I cultivate stays true.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.11,0:19:34.67,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}I contemplate the wisdom of heaven and earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.15,0:19:34.67,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}I shall choose my path between karma and fate.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.75,0:19:40.07,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}My unshakable Dao Heart
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.51,0:19:40.07,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}aspires to ascend.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.43,0:19:46.31,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}Defying,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.75,0:19:46.31,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}this is what my journey to treading the heavens relies on.
